":null,"minutesStatus":0,"minutesSummaryDocumentId":"","minutesSummaryDocumentIds":[],"newMeetingDate":null,"newMeetingTime":null,"packetFileSize":278647,"packetFileSizeThreshold":314572800,"recurringId":1924,"recurringType":"NoRepeat","startDateTime":"2026-11-10T06:00:00.000Z","startTime":"04:45 PM","thumbnailOfVideo":"","videoId":"","videoName":null,"videoStatus":""},{"actualEndDate":"2026-11-10 00:00:00.0","actualStartDate":"2026-11-10 00:00:00.0","adjourned":false,"agendaItemAttachmentTitles":[],"agendaItemDescriptions":[],"agendaItemTitles":[],"agendaOCRedContent":"","agendaPacketDocumentId":"DOC622S1202","agendaPacketDocumentIds":["DOC622S1202"],"agendaPacketEnabled":false,"agendaPostedDate":"2026-11-06T15:55:36.000Z","agendaSectionHeaderDescriptions":["<div>Comments will be limited to three minutes, step to the microphone, state your name and city of residence, and fill out the required form.</div>","<div>Staff, sponsor presentations, and public comments will be given prior to Council action on the following matter. The Council Meeting Agenda Packet can be found HERE. </div>","<div>Supporting materials are available for inspection on the Murray City website at www.murray.utah.gov.<br><br>Special accommodations for the hearing or visually impaired will be made upon a request to the office of the Murray City Recorder<br>(801-264-2663). We would appreciate notification two working days prior to the meeting. TTY is Relay Utah at #711.<br><br>Council Members may participate in the meeting via telephonic communication. If a Council Member does participate via telephonic communication, the Council Member will be on speaker phone. The speaker phone will be amplified so that the other Council Members and all other persons present in the Council Chambers will be able to hear all discussions.<br><br>No less than 24 hours before the meeting, a copy of the foregoing notice was posted in conspicuous view in the front foyer of the Murray City Center, Murray, Utah. Copies of